## Requirement closure. (base)
module mission

## Whether an achieved value closes a requirement, and by how much. sense 0: the achieved value is
## at most the requirement; 1: at least. Requirement and achieved value are the same quantity in
## SI (the language has no generic units: the caller holds them to one).
fn closure(req: real[1] in 0.001 .. 1000, ach: real[1] in 0.001 .. 1000, sense: int in 0 .. 1) -> (closed: bool, margin: real[1])
    if sense == 0
        margin = req - ach
    else
        margin = ach - req
    end
    closed = margin >= 0
end
